This package adapts selected source files from AxiomMath/Stacks at revision
c496df0d9beea9deaeabcea8492605f9a0a2313b.

The upstream Apache-2.0 LICENSE is included verbatim. Source-file copyright,
author notices and mathematical source references are retained.

Import paths are remapped to the contribution prefix. Metadata-only
Stacks/SGA/EGA annotations and commands are omitted. Limited fixed-pin
proof-API adaptations are documented in MODIFICATIONS.md.

The ComplexProduct wrapper is additional supporting code proving reducedness
on the existing complex over-category product.
